{"version":1,"content":"<p>影后舒淇演而優則導，早前憑處女執導作品《女孩》摘下金馬獎「最佳新導演」殊榮， 昨日（27日）在社交網發文重溫喜悅，坦言從李安及奉俊昊兩位名導手中接過獎座宛如作夢。</p><p>她又特別附上與恩師侯孝賢昔日的青澀合照，感激對方的提攜與教誨，並引述恩師金句：</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T16:21:30.823354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T16:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:42.084695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:42.084695+00:00","content_hash":"67e4d33c30335b1a95b9fb288c10acd3c60d6cb7270ced852696b128fd4fb4c1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}